cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TaxaCurate: post-taxonomic-assignment curation of COI metabarcoding results"
abstract: >-
  TaxaCurate is an R/Shiny application that curates taxonomic assignments
  from COI metabarcoding. It resolves BLAST, BOLD and MZG assignments to WoRMS
  AphiaIDs, compares the databases per ASV and taxonomic level, assembles a
  final ASV table, removes contaminants, aggregates to taxa and enriches
  species with WoRMS taxonomy, marine status, distribution, ecological traits
  and North Sea occurrence evidence (OBIS, GBIF and WoRMS distribution text).
type: software
